###get all tags
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tags
Accept: application/json

###get tag by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tags/id/952
Accept: application/json

###get tags on video by video id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tags/videoId/1
Accept: application/json

###get tags on video by video id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tags/videoId/1
Accept: application/json